#: ../../source/coa_README.md:94
msgid "Cmd"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:95
msgid "Command is a top level entity. Commands may have options and arguments."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:97
msgid "Cmd.api"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:98
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Returns object containing all its subcommands as methods to use from "
"other programs.<br> **@returns** *{Object}*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:101
msgid "Cmd.name"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:102
msgid ""
"Set a canonical command identifier to be used anywhere in the API.<br> "
"**@param** *String* `_name` command name<br> **@returns** *COA.Cmd* "
"`this` instance (for chainability)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:106
msgid "Cmd.title"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:107
msgid ""
"Set a long description for command to be used anywhere in text "
"messages.<br> **@param** *String* `_title` command title<br> **@returns**"
" *COA.Cmd* `this` instance (for chainability)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:111
msgid "Cmd.cmd"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:112
msgid ""
"Create new or add existing subcommand for current command.<br> **@param**"
" *COA.Cmd* `[cmd]` existing command instance<br> **@returns** *COA.Cmd* "
"new or added subcommand instance"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:116
msgid "Cmd.opt"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:117
msgid ""
"Create option for current command.<br> **@returns** *COA.Opt* `new` "
"option instance"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:120
msgid "Cmd.arg"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:121
msgid ""
"Create argument for current command.<br> **@returns** *COA.Opt* `new` "
"argument instance"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:124
msgid "Cmd.act"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:125
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Add (or set) action for current command.<br> **@param** *Function* `act` "
"action function,     invoked in the context of command instance     and "
"has the parameters:<br>         - *Object* `opts` parsed options<br>"
"         - *Array* `args` parsed arguments<br>         - *Object* `res` "
"actions result accumulator<br>     It can return rejected promise by "
"Cmd.reject (in case of error)     or any other value treated as "
"result.<br> **@param** *{Boolean}* [force=false] flag for set action "
"instead add to existings<br> **@returns** *COA.Cmd* `this` instance (for "
"chainability)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:137
msgid "Cmd.apply"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:138
msgid ""
"Apply function with arguments in context of command instance.<br> "
"**@param** *Function* `fn`<br> **@param** *Array* `args`<br> **@returns**"
" *COA.Cmd* `this` instance (for chainability)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:143
msgid "Cmd.comp"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:144
msgid ""
"Set custom additional completion for current command.<br> **@param** "
"*Function* `fn` completion generation function,     invoked in the "
"context of command instance.     Accepts parameters:<br>         - "
"*Object* `opts` completion options<br>     It can return promise or any "
"other value treated as result.<br> **@returns** *COA.Cmd* `this` instance"
" (for chainability)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:152
msgid "Cmd.helpful"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:153
msgid ""
"Make command \"helpful\", i.e. add -h --help flags for print usage.<br> "
"**@returns** *COA.Cmd* `this` instance (for chainability)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:156
msgid "Cmd.completable"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:157
msgid ""
"Adds shell completion to command, adds \"completion\" subcommand, that "
"makes all the magic.<br> Must be called only on root command.<br> "
"**@returns** *COA.Cmd* `this` instance (for chainability)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:161
msgid "Cmd.usage"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:162
msgid ""
"Build full usage text for current command instance.<br> **@returns** "
"*String* `usage` text"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:165
msgid "Cmd.run"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:166
msgid ""
"Parse arguments from simple format like NodeJS process.argv and run ahead"
" current program, i.e. call process.exit when all actions done.<br> "
"**@param** *Array* `argv`<br> **@returns** *COA.Cmd* `this` instance (for"
" chainability)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:171
msgid "Cmd.invoke"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:172
msgid ""
"Invoke specified (or current) command using provided options and "
"arguments.<br> **@param** *String|Array* `cmds`  subcommand to invoke "
"(optional)<br> **@param** *Object* `opts`  command options (optional)<br>"
" **@param** *Object* `args`  command arguments (optional)<br> "
"**@returns** *Q.Promise*"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:178
msgid "Cmd.reject"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:179
msgid ""
"Return reject of actions results promise.<br> Use in .act() for return "
"with error.<br> **@param** *Object* `reason` reject reason<br>     You "
"can customize toString() method and exitCode property     of reason "
"object.<br> **@returns** *Q.promise* rejected promise"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:186
msgid "Cmd.end"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:187
msgid ""
"Finish chain for current subcommand and return parent command "
"instance.<br> **@returns** *COA.Cmd* `parent` command"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:190
msgid "Opt"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:191
msgid ""
"Option is a named entity. Options may have short and long keys for use "
"from command line.<br> **@namespace**<br> **@class** Presents option"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:195
msgid "Opt.name"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:196
msgid ""
"Set a canonical option identifier to be used anywhere in the API.<br> "
"**@param** *String* `_name` option name<br> **@returns** *COA.Opt* `this`"
" instance (for chainability)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:200
msgid "Opt.title"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:201
msgid ""
"Set a long description for option to be used anywhere in text "
"messages.<br> **@param** *String* `_title` option title<br> **@returns** "
"*COA.Opt* `this` instance (for chainability)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:205
msgid "Opt.short"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:206
msgid ""
"Set a short key for option to be used with one hyphen from command "
"line.<br> **@param** *String* `_short`<br> **@returns** *COA.Opt* `this` "
"instance (for chainability)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:210
msgid "Opt.long"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:211
msgid ""
"Set a short key for option to be used with double hyphens from command "
"line.<br> **@param** *String* `_long`<br> **@returns** *COA.Opt* `this` "
"instance (for chainability)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:215
msgid "Opt.flag"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:216
msgid ""
"Make an option boolean, i.e. option without value.<br> **@returns** "
"*COA.Opt* `this` instance (for chainability)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:219
msgid "Opt.arr"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:220
msgid ""
"Makes an option accepts multiple values.<br> Otherwise, the value will be"
" used by the latter passed.<br> **@returns** *COA.Opt* `this` instance "
"(for chainability)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:224
msgid "Opt.req"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:225
msgid ""
"Makes an option req.<br> **@returns** *COA.Opt* `this` instance (for "
"chainability)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:228
msgid "Opt.only"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:229
msgid ""
"Makes an option to act as a command, i.e. program will exit just after "
"option action.<br> **@returns** *COA.Opt* `this` instance (for "
"chainability)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:233
msgid "Opt.val"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:234
msgid ""
"Set a validation (or value) function for argument.<br> Value from command"
" line passes through before becoming available from API.<br> Using for "
"validation and convertion simple types to any values.<br> **@param** "
"*Function* `_val` validating function,     invoked in the context of "
"option instance     and has one parameter with value from command "
"line<br> **@returns** *COA.Opt* `this` instance (for chainability)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:242
msgid "Opt.def"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:243
msgid ""
"Set a default value for option. Default value passed through validation "
"function as ordinary value.<br> **@param** *Object* `_def`<br> "
"**@returns** *COA.Opt* `this` instance (for chainability)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:248
msgid "Opt.input"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:249
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"Make option value inputting stream. It's add useful validation and "
"shortcut for STDIN. **@returns** *{COA.Opt}* `this` instance (for "
"chainability)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:253
msgid "Opt.output"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:254
msgid ""
"Make option value outputing stream.<br> It's add useful validation and "
"shortcut for STDOUT.<br> **@returns** *COA.Opt* `this` instance (for "
"chainability)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:258
msgid "Opt.act"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:259
msgid ""
"Add action for current option command. This action is performed if the "
"current option is present in parsed options (with any value).<br> "
"**@param** *Function* `act` action function,     invoked in the context "
"of command instance     and has the parameters:<br>         - *Object* "
"`opts` parsed options<br>         - *Array* `args` parsed arguments<br>"
"         - *Object* `res` actions result accumulator<br>     It can "
"return rejected promise by Cmd.reject (in case of error)     or any other"
" value treated as result.<br> **@returns** *COA.Opt* `this` instance (for"
" chainability)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:272
msgid "Opt.comp"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:273
msgid ""
"Set custom additional completion for current option.<br> **@param** "
"*Function* `fn` completion generation function,     invoked in the "
"context of command instance.     Accepts parameters:<br>         - "
"*Object* `opts` completion options<br>     It can return promise or any "
"other value treated as result.<br> **@returns** *COA.Opt* `this` instance"
" (for chainability)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:281
msgid "Opt.end"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/coa_README.md:282 ../../source/coa_README.md:339
msgid ""
"Finish chain for current option and return parent command instance.<br> "
"**@returns** *COA.Cmd* `parent` command"
msgstr ""

